  {
   "text": "Four Marvel Super Heroes Commander decks were released together with Marvel Super Heroes on June 26, 2026. These are meant to be on-ramps to Commander , with new cards and reprints.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "The majority of the decks each contain :",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 ready-to-play 100-card Commander deck 1 borderless traditional foil face commander card 29 other new-to- Magic cards",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 double-sided tokens",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Fantastic Four deck, due to its theming, contains :",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 ready-to-play 100-card Commander deck 4 borderless traditional foil face commander cards 26 other new-to- Magic cards",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 double-sided tokens",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "In total, the decks feature 120 new cards and 170 new art reprints (including 15 skinned cards ).",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "All four of these decks are also available in a Collector's Edition, retailing for MSRP $149.99. For each deck, all 100 of the cards are printed in a surge foil treatment and the non-foil tokens have been replaced with tokens that are surge foil on one face and non-foil on the other.",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Collector's Edition"
  },
  {
   "text": "In addition to the June 26 release, Marvel Super Heroes features a holiday release slated for a December 4, 2026. This is a Spider-Man centric Commander deck .",
   "scene": 4,
   "section": "Holiday Release"
  },
  {
   "text": "Similar to the main Commander decks, this decks is also available in a 100% Surge Foil Collector's Edition. The deck features 50 new pieces of art: ~30 new cards and 20 reprints. Reprints are from both Marvel's Spider-Man and Marvel Super Heroes . The regular version appears in six languages. The Collector's Edition is English only.",
   "scene": 4,
   "section": "Holiday Release"
  },
